  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-I Polymer</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-II Type/Class</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>Nylon-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>-Nylon-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td>Thermosetting polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>Buna-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td>Biodegradable polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>Ureaformaldehyde resin</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td>Synthetic rubber</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>Dacron</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td>Polyester</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
