  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Thermoset plastics retain their form and stay solid under heat once cured.&nbsp;Urea-formaldehyde is an example of thermosetting polymer.&nbsp;Polymers which disintegrate by themselves over a period of time due to environmental degradation by bacteria etc. are called biodegradable polymers. Nylon-2-nylon-6 is an example of&nbsp;biodegradable polymer.&nbsp;Any artificial elastomer is referred to as synthetic rubber. Buna-N is an example of synthetic rubber.&nbsp;Polyester is a synthetic or man-made fiber material. Dacron is an example polyester.</p></blockquote>",
